{"sha": "b9f854af5faf6f631cbdd9cba57e07211c8d1401e2c85693f1c0aa8b3ecd0f95", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.45\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g10-squash-jug.jpg}", "", "{\\small 瓶装果汁在壶中加水稀释：饮料中果汁糖浆的量不变，", "但体积更大。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{通过溶解配制溶液}", "", "\\begin{method}[溶解固体配制溶液]\\label{met:g10:concentration-and-dilution:dissolving}", "欲配制体积为 $V$、物质的量浓度为 $c$ 的溶液：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 计算所需物质的量 $n = c \\times V$，", "        以及需称取的质量 $m = n \\times M$。", "  \\item 用天平在小表面皿中称取该质量的固体。", "  \\item 通过漏斗将固体倒入体积为", "        $V$ 的容量瓶中；用蒸馏水冲洗表面皿和漏斗，", "        使洗液全部进入容量瓶，确保固体无损失。", "  \\item 加入蒸馏水至容量瓶约半满，", "        摇动直至固体全部溶解。", "  \\item 加蒸馏水至刻度线，最后几滴用滴管加入；", "        塞好瓶塞，上下颠倒数次使其混匀。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.05]", "  % 1. weigh", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {balance};", "  \\fill[black!8, draw=black!55] (-0.45,0.8) -- (0.45,0.8) -- (0.38,0.98)", "    -- (-0.38,0.98) -- cycle;", "  \\fill[white, draw=black!40] (-0.25,0.98) .. controls (-0.1,1.15) and", "    (0.1,1.15) .. (0.25,0.98) -- cycle;", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (0,-0.2) {1. 称量\\\\ 固体};", "  % 2. transfer through a funnel", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (3.2,0) {volflask={0.08}{omWater}};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (3.2,3.0) {funnel};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, -{Stealth}] (2.4,5.0) -- (2.85,4.65);", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (3.2,-0.2) {2. 转移，\\\\ 冲洗};", "  % 3. half full, swirl", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (6.4,0) {volflask={0.45}{omWater}};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, -{Stealth}] (5.55,0.5) arc[start angle=200,", "    end angle=340, x radius=0.9, y radius=0.3];", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (6.4,-0.2) {3. 半满：\\\\ 摇动溶解};", "  % 4. to the mark", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (9.6,0) {volflask={1}{omWater}};", "  \\fill[black!45] (9.43,3.6) rectangle (9.77,3.85);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, <-] (9.82,2.9) -- (10.6,3.3) node[right] {刻度线};", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (9.6,-0.2) {4. 加至刻度，\\\\", "    塞好，混匀};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 通过溶解固体配制溶液：称量、转移、溶解，", "然后加水至容量瓶的刻度线。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{inthelab}[定容]", "容量瓶的刻度线是瓶颈上的一圈标记。细玻璃管中的水", "面并不平整，液面中央向下凹，形成弯月面。", "当眼睛与刻度线平齐，弯月面的\\emph{最低点}恰好与刻度线相切时，", "容量瓶即已装满，此时前后两侧的刻度环看起来连成一条线。", "从上方或下方观察，", "液面看起来可能正好，", "实际却未必如此。", "\\end{inthelab}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\newcommand{\\neck}[2]{% x, meniscus bottom height", "    \\fill[omWater] (#1-0.5,0) -- (#1-0.5,{#2+0.25}) .. controls", "      (#1-0.25,#2) and (#1+0.25,#2) .. (#1+0.5,{#2+0.25}) -- (#1+0.5,0) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[black!60, line width=0.8pt] (#1-0.5,0) -- (#1-0.5,3);", "    \\draw[black!60, line width=0.8pt] (#1+0.5,0) -- (#1+0.5,3);", "    \\draw[omDef, line width=0.9pt] (#1-0.5,1.5) -- (#1+0.5,1.5);", "    \\draw[black!50] (#1-0.5,{#2+0.25}) .. controls (#1-0.25,#2) and", "      (#1+0.25,#2) .. (#1+0.5,{#2+0.25});}", "  \\newcommand{\\eye}[2]{% x, y: an eye looking to the right", "    \\draw[black!70] (#1-0.25,#2) .. controls (#1-0.1,#2+0.18) and", "      (#1+0.1,#2+0.18) .. (#1+0.2,#2) .. controls (#1+0.1,#2-0.18) and", "      (#1-0.1,#2-0.18) .. (#1-0.25,#2);", "    \\fill[black!70] (#1+0.05,#2) circle (0.06);}", "  % right", "  \\neck{1.5}{1.5}", "  \\eye{-0.4}{1.5}", "  \\draw[dashed, black!50] (-0.1,1.5) -- (2.4,1.5);", "  \\node[align=center] at (1.5,-0.55) {正确：视线平齐，\\\\ 弯月面底部在刻度线};", "  % too high", "  \\neck{6}{1.85}", "  \\eye{4.1}{1.85}", "  \\draw[dashed, black!50] (4.4,1.85) -- (6.9,1.85);", "  \\node[align=center] at (6,-0.55) {水过多：\\\\ 弯月面在上方};", "  % too low", "  \\neck{10.5}{0.85}", "  \\eye{8.6}{0.85}", "  \\draw[dashed, black!50] (8.9,0.85) -- (11.4,0.85);", "  \\node[align=center] at (10.5,-0.55) {水过少：\\\\ 弯月面在下方};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 容量瓶瓶颈放大图，图中为从弯月面高度处观察的视线，", "图中蓝线为刻度线。", "只有左侧的容量瓶液面正确。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{稀释}", "", "\\begin{definition}[稀释、母液、稀释倍数]\\label{def:g10:concentration-and-dilution:dilution}", "\\emph{稀释}\\index{稀释}是降低溶液浓度的过程，", "即加入溶剂。开始时取用的浓溶液称为", "\\emph{母液}\\index{母液}。", "\\emph{稀释倍数}\\index{稀释倍数} $F$ 为母液浓度与", "稀释后溶液浓度之比：", "\\[", "  F = \\frac{c_{\\text{母液}}}{c_{\\text{稀释后}}} .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", ""]}